        },
        {
          "text": "Samuelini waan jed'eeni. AABBO Waaqi saala fed'a mo waan gubani isaa baasanifi sorio fed'a? Saalfachaani isaa saalfatani gabbinna ilmoole hoola ta isaa sorio baasani kennanifi ira jirti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diditini isa didani akuma falfala hamtu. Kiyyibi isa durati kiyyibanileeni akuma nama waaqa harkani mid'aasani kad'ate hama. Waan atini dubbi AABBO Waaqa diddeefi, innileeni aka atini hayyu tate worra Israeli dura deemtu ya dide.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauloni waan jed'eeni, Anini yayu ch'ubbu tolche, dubbi AABBO Waaqatifi jecha kanketile guutu dide. Anini askarti tiyya sodaad'e dubbi worraa gula bahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo amma anini si kad'ad'a ch'ubbu tiyya naa araarami, ammalle Gilgaliti na woliini deebii, aka anini AABBO Waaqale kad'ad'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Samuelini waan jed'eeni, Anini si woliini indeebiu, atini yayu dubbi AABBO Waaqa didde, innileeni yayu aka atini hayyu Israeli taatu si dide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 28.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.30+1KI.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Hay 11.30-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Samuelini deema garagallaani Sauloni fit'e woya isaa qabe duuba woyaani tarsaate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuelini waan isani jed'e, Arra AABBO Waaqi yayu hayyuma atini Israeliini fiddu siraa fuud'e, nama sira jiru d'ibii kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi guddaani Israeli d'ara indubbatu yokhaani heregi isaa garaingalu. Inni namaaniti, ka herega garagalfatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauloni waan jed'eeni, Anini yayu ch'ubbu tolche, ammo hataatuti atini jaarole gosa tiyyatifi worra Israeli ch'ufa durati na inch'eersini na woliini deemi, aka anini AABBO Waaqa kad'ad'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Samuelini Saulo woliini deeme, Sauloni AABBO Waaqa kad'ate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Samuelini waan jed'e, Agagi hayyu Amaleki natiini koota. Jennaani Agagini ka nahe hollate lubbuuni d'ufte garaa ufi keesati bada, dooti akami nama d'ibdi? jed'u isa dura d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuelini waan jed'eeni, Akuma goraadeeni tante hawani heddu ilme d'owarte akasuma amma tana haati tante ilme d'abdi. Jennaani Samuelini Agagi Gilgaliti AABBO Waaqa durati garagari ch'ire ijeese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Samuelini Ramati iti d'aabate, ammo Sauloni worra isaa ka Gibeati gale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi suni Samuelini taka jireenna ufi keesa Saulo inagarre, ammo guddo boheefi. AABBO Waaqileeni waan Saulo hayyu Israeli tolcheefi guddo gaabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Daudi muudani hayyu tolchani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
